  "description": "The Axios Junior is a BMX race-inspired bike that's designed for young riders transitioning from a youth size to their first 20\" BMX bike. This bike is great for rides at the bike park, pump track or first laps at the BMX track.\nLightweight 6061 aluminum BMX frame – great for young riders. 18.25\" top tube length fits riders 4' to 5'1\" tall.\nDrivetrain features 152 mm one-piece Hi-Ten steel cranks with a 42T chainring and American loose ball bottom bracket.\n20” x 1.75” tires mounted on aluminum single wall 36H rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 16T cog steel rear hub.\nHi-ten steel handlebar and fork, 48 mm stem, threadless 1-1/8\" external headset, and aluminum linear pull brakes and brake levers.",
